{"results": [{"id": "W2052218930", "title": "The Pen Is Mightier Than the Keyboard: Advantages of Longhand Over Laptop Note Taking", "year": 2014, "snippet": "Mueller and Oppenheimer (2014) found longhand note takers performed better on conceptual questions than laptop note takers, but laptop note takers recorded more content."}, {"id": "W2963827748", "title": "Note-taking and review: The role of longhand versus laptop note-taking in learning", "year": 2019, "snippet": "This study examined whether reviewing notes moderates the longhand advantage. Across two experiments, longhand note takers did not outperform laptop note takers, and review did not produce a reliable longhand advantage."}, {"id": "W3032345678", "title": "The impact of note-taking medium and review on recall", "year": 2020, "snippet": "Laptop note takers recorded more words; reviewing notes improved recall similarly for both mediums, with no significant medium-by-review interaction."}, {"id": "W3098765432", "title": "Longhand versus laptop note-taking: A meta-analysis", "year": 2021, "snippet": "Meta-analysis found no reliable overall advantage of longhand over laptop note-taking; effects varied by outcome and study design."}]}
</observation>{"thought": "I need to fetch the most directly relevant source on note review as a moderator before citing it.", "action": "fetch_source", "args": {"source_id": "W2963827748"}}

<observation>
{"id": "W2963827748", "title": "Note-taking and review: The role of longhand versus laptop note-taking in learning", "year": 2019, "abstract": "We examined whether reviewing notes moderates the widely reported longhand advantage over laptop note-taking. In two experiments, participants watched video lectures, took notes by hand or laptop, and either reviewed or did not review their notes before a comprehension test. Across both experiments, longhand note takers did not outperform laptop note takers on conceptual or factual questions. Reviewing notes improved test performance overall, but there was no significant note-taking medium by review interaction. The results suggest that note review does not change the handwriting versus laptop effect."}
</observation>{"thought": "I will fetch a second source that directly tests medium and review to see whether it corroborates the null interaction.", "action": "fetch_source", "args": {"source_id": "W3032345678"}}

